I am waiting for the SMS with my code.
But my phone stays completely silent.
I look at the screen and check the reception.
The signal is good.
Normally these messages arrive immediately.
I wait another minute.
Then the screen goes dark.
I tap on the phone again.
The page is still asking for the code.
I do not want to sit on the sofa and wait any longer.
So I open the help section on the website.
I find an alternative there.
I click on a different link.
A new text appears on the screen.
It says there: 'A new code is being sent to your old email address.'
Mostly that is faster anyway.
I open my emails and copy the numbers.
Then I enter the code into the form.
My data is now finally being updated.
The whole thing takes only four minutes in total.
